| Revenue | $1.42M |
| COGS | $696K |
| Gross profit | $722K |
| Gross margin | 51% |
| Orders | 6,200 |
| Units sold | 14,244 |

**Answer:** The business earns about 51 cents of gross profit on every dollar of revenue. These KPI cards update with the slicers.

