### Q6. When does revenue peak, and does profit follow?
**Answer:** With 2024 and 2025 combined, November ($135K) and June ($135K) are the strongest months. February and March (about $97K each) are the weakest. Profit moves almost in step with revenue, so margin stays around 50-51% all year.

